# Live: Browser > Named Views, as in the familiar tool. Open the folder,
# double-click FRONT (the camera glides there), right-click the folder >
# New Named View saves it, TOP looks down, the saved view brings the front
# back; rename it in place.
waitfor tsr.feature.extrude
wait 600
bdclick Named_Views           # double-click opens the folder
wait 300
bdclick FRONT
expectaxis z 0 -1             # Z up the screen
expectaxis x 1 0
expectaxis y 0 0              # Y straight into it
brclick Named_Views
waitfor browserNewView
click browserNewView
wait 400
bdclick TOP
expectaxis y 0 -1
expectaxis z 0 0
bdclick Named_View_1
expectaxis z 0 -1
expectaxis y 0 0
shot /tmp/live_named_views.png
brclick Named_View_1
waitfor browserRenameView
click browserRenameView
wait 300
type Side
key Return
wait 500
